# GOV.UK Trade Tariff API changelog

Last updated: <%= data.changelog.first.date %>

Change types:

- `added`: new endpoint, field or filter. Existing clients keep working.
- `breaking`: existing clients can fail. Update your integration.
- `deprecated`: the old behaviour is going away. It stops on the sunset date, if one is shown.

Machine-readable version: https://docs.trade-tariff.service.gov.uk/api-changelog.json

